<title>UK: Higher prices keep UK meals/feed buyers away.</title>
<headline>Higher prices keep UK meals/feed buyers away.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Higher UK meals and feeds prices on Wednesday following gains in Chicago on Tuesday once again kept buyers out of the market.</p>
<p>&quot;What we need is a big fall in Chicago just to get buyers interested again,&quot; said a trader.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal from the mill was one to two stg higher while stores were around 0.50 stg up.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
